      "trackName": "Dice Dice Incremental",
      "description": "DDI is an incremental game for your wrist.\n\n  Tap to roll, collect coins, and build your way through a deep upgrade system, all from your wrist.\n\n  Features:\n  - Roll up to 12 dice per throw\n  - Combos: pairs, triples, up to eight-of-a-kind\n  - Prestige system with 7 major unlocks\n  - Offline earnings while the app is closed\n  - Brutal Mode: negative dice faces for higher risk\n  - Custom symbol dice with tiered bonus rewards\n  - Lucky Sprout fate die for roll multipliers\n  - Phone companion app with live stats",
